      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 5.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.18,
      "end_seconds": 10.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 16.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yeah, it's night sweats. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.75,
      "end_seconds": 20.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "so, how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.63,
      "end_seconds": 25.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "about... well, about three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.28,
      "end_seconds": 35.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.1,
      "end_seconds": 40.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Changing the sheets helps a bit. I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.43,
      "end_seconds": 45.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.58,
      "end_seconds": 49.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.36,
      "end_seconds": 55.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.68,
      "end_seconds": 60.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.0,
      "end_seconds": 68.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here. What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.5,
      "end_seconds": 73.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "It's rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.34,
      "end_seconds": 78.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.45,
      "end_seconds": 85.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.77,
      "end_seconds": 95.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.21,
      "end_seconds": 100.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.61,
      "end_seconds": 104.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.93,
      "end_seconds": 108.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.83,
      "end_seconds": 112.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.03,
      "end_seconds": 117.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.43,
      "end_seconds": 135.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Have you noticed difficulty swallowing, blood in the stool, bone pain or itching?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.36,
      "end_seconds": 144.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "no difficulty swallowing, blood in the stool, bone pain or itching, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.59,
      "end_seconds": 151.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.36,
      "end_seconds": 155.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.0,
      "end_seconds": 176.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.47,
      "end_seconds": 187.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.02,
      "end_seconds": 209.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, temp 36.4 degrees, BP is 128 over 79. And pulse is 65 beats a minute, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.79,
      "end_seconds": 212.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 217.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Alright, I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.86,
      "end_seconds": 224.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.15,
      "end_seconds": 228.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "so, stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.25,
      "end_seconds": 242.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.78,
      "end_seconds": 248.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.65,
      "end_seconds": 276.38,
      "duration_seconds": 14.73,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.28,
      "end_seconds": 281.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Well, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 299.52,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up, and we'll watch how it goes. Today I'm not changing anything. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.03,
      "end_seconds": 304.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}